# The exported web build lives on Cloudflare R2, not in this repo --
# index.pck/.wasm alone are 400+ MB, way past GitHub's 100MB file limit.
# See index.html's game-play-trigger JS: it embeds the R2-hosted build via
# iframe, this folder is just the local staging copy used to build the R2
# upload.
game/*
!game/.gitkeep
game-ru/*
game-en/*
